  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "There are options for custom walking, sprinting, crouching animations, etc. But there isn't one for Jumping or an Idle that triggers after a certain amount of time of inactivity. (So basically an AFK animation.)\n\nI know a majority of the issue is just simply that there isn't any default animations for these. All we really need is these animation slots available for players.\nI've had several ideas for jumping animations, but can't apply them to any of my models because they aren't an option.",
